    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Qolalkii Wadaaddada",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo haddana wuxuu i geeyey barxaddii dibadda dhankeeda woqooyi, oo wuxuu i geliyey qolladdii meesha goonida ah ka soo hor jeedday oo dhismaha xagga woqooyi ka soo hor jeedday. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo dhinaca dheer oo dhererkiisu boqol dhudhun ahaa ayaa albaabka woqooyi ku hor yiil, oo ballaadhkiisuna wuxuu ahaa konton dhudhun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Barxadda gudaha oo dhererkeedu labaatanka dhudhun ahaa horteeda iyo meesha sallaxa ah barxadda dibadda horteeda waxaa ku yiil balbalo balbalo kale ka soo hor jeedda oo saddex dabaqadood ah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo qolladaha hortoodana waxaa ku yiil jid ballaadhkiisu toban dhudhun yahay, dhererkiisuna boqol dhudhun yahay, oo albaabbadooduna waxay u sii jeedeen xagga woqooyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba qolladaha sare way ka cidhiidhsanaayeen kuwa hoose iyo kuwa dhexe ee dhismaha, waayo, balbalooyinku meeshay yareeyeen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waayo, iyagu waxay ahaayeen saddex dabaqadood, laakiinse tiirar kuwa barxadaha la mid ah ma ay lahayn, sidaas daraaddeed kuwa sare way ka cidhiidhsanaayeen qolladaha hoose iyo kuwa dhexeba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo derbigii dibadda oo ku ag yiil qolladihii xagga barxadda dibadda u sii jeeday oo xagga hore oo qolladaha ku yiil dhererkiisu wuxuu ahaa konton dhudhun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waayo, qolladihii barxadda dibadda ku yiil dhererkoodu wuxuu ahaa konton dhudhun, oo bal eeg, macbudka hortiisu waxay ahayd boqol dhudhun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo qolladahaas hoostooda waxaa ku yiil iriddii dhinaca bari laga geli jiray, meeshii iyaga xagga barxadda looga soo galo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo qollado baa ku yiil derbigii barxadda xagga bari oo ka soo hor jeeda xagga meesha goonida ah iyo xagga dhismaha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo jidkii hortooda ku yiil wuxuu u ekaa sidii kii qolladaha xagga woqooyi ku yiil oo kale. Sidooda oo kaluu u dheeraa oo sidoodoo kaluu u ballaadhnaa, oo meelahooda laga baxo oo dhammuna waxay ahaayeen sida qaabkoodoo kale iyo sida albaabbadooda oo kale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo qolladihii xagga koonfureed u sii jeeday albaabbadoodiina waxay lahaayeen albaab jidka madaxiisa ku yiil, kaasoo ah jidkii derbiga xagga bari ka soo hor jeeday, markii iyaga la soo galo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo markaasuu igu yidhi, Qolladaha woqooyi iyo qolladaha koonfureed oo meesha goonida ah ka soo hor jeeda waa qolladaha quduuska ah oo wadaaddada Rabbiga u soo dhowaadaa ay waxyaalaha quduuska ah ku cunaan, oo waxay halkaas dhigi doonaan waxyaalaha aad u quduuska ah, iyo qurbaanka hadhuudhka, iyo qurbaanka dembiga, iyo qurbaanka xadgudubka, waayo, meeshaasu waa quduus. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo markii ay wadaaddadu soo galaan waa inaanay meesha quduuska ah ka bixin inay barxadda dibadda tagaan, laakiinse waa inay meeshaas dhigtaan dharkooda markay adeegayaan ay xidhaan, waayo, iyagu waa quduus, oo waa inay dhar kale xidhaan markay u soo dhowaadaan waxyaalaha dadka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba markuu qiyaasiddii daarta gudaha dhammaystiray ayuu iriddii xagga bari u sii jeedday iga bixiyey, oo wuxuu qiyaasay hareereheedii oo dhan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dhankii bari ayuu cawsduurkii qiyaasta ku qiyaasay, oo wuxuu ahaa shan boqol oo cawsduur, oo cawsduurkii qiyaasta ayuu ku soo wada wareejiyey. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dhankii woqooyi cawsduurkii qiyaasta ayuu ku qiyaasay, oo wuxuu ahaa shan boqol oo cawsduur. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo dhankii koonfureedna wuu ku qiyaasay cawsduurkii qiyaasta, oo wuxuu ahaa shan boqol oo cawsduur. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo markaasuu dhankii galbeed u leexday, oo shan boqol oo cawsduur ayuu cawsduurkii qiyaasta ku qiyaasay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo afartii dhinacba wuu ka qiyaasay, oo waxay lahayd derbi ku wareegsan oo dhererkiisu yahay shan boqol oo cawsduur, oo ballaadhkiisuna yahay shan boqol oo cawsduur, wuxuuna u kala dhexeeyey meesha quduuska ah iyo meesha aan quduuska ahayn.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
